  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">The function \(D\) is defined by the equation \(D(x)=2.5x +12\).</para>
<para dir="ltr"><span>Which describes the window that can be used to find the value of \(x\) when \(D(x)=23.25\) using graphing technology and gives the correct value of \(x\)?</span></para></section>
</content>
